<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SUN CITY, South Africa 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>scores in the Million Dollar Challenge golf tournament at the</p>
<p>Gary Player Country Club on Friday:</p>
<p>136 Colin Montgomerie (Britain) 65 71</p>
<p>137 Ian Woosnam (Britain) 68 69, Ernie Els (South Africa) 67 70</p>
<p>138 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 71 67, Steve Jones (U.S.) 67 71,</p>
<p>Steve</p>
<p>Stricker (U.S.) 68 70, Mark Brooks (U.S.) 68 70</p>
<p>139 Bernhard Langer (Germany) 69 70, Corey Pavin (U.S.) 68 71</p>
<p>140 Mark O'Meara (U.S.) 69 71</p>
<p>141 Nick Faldo (Britain) 73 68</p>
<p>142 Tom Lehman (U.S.) 71 71</p>
</text>
